ngtcp2
------------------------------------------
ngtcp2 project is an effort to implement QUIC protocol which is now being
discussed in IETF QUICWG for its standardization.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libgnutls-devel-3.8.13-1
  libgnutls30-3.8.13-1
  libngtcp2-devel-1.25.0-1bl1
  libngtcp2_16-1.25.0-1bl1
  libngtcp2_crypto_gnutls-devel-1.25.0-1bl1
  libngtcp2_crypto_gnutls8-1.25.0-1bl1
  libngtcp2_crypto_ossl-devel-1.25.0-1bl1
  libngtcp2_crypto_ossl0-1.25.0-1bl1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libbrotli-devel-1.2.0-2
  libev-devel-4.33-1
  libgnutls-devel-3.8.13-1
  libnghttp3-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/ngtcp2/ngtcp2

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/ngtcp2/ngtcp2.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack ngtcp2-1.25.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./ngtcp2-1.25.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/ngtcp2-1.25.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/ngtcp2-1.25.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libngtcp2_16-1.25.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libngtcp2_crypto_gnutls8-1.25.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libngtcp2_crypto_ossl0-1.25.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libngtcp2-devel-1.25.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libngtcp2_crypto_gnutls-devel-1.25.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libngtcp2_crypto_ossl-devel-1.25.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(ngtcp2)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/ngtcp2.README
  /usr/share/doc/ngtcp2/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/ngtcp2/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/ngtcp2/README
  /usr/share/doc/ngtcp2/README.rst
  /usr/share/doc/ngtcp2/SECURITY.md

(libngtcp2_16)
  /usr/bin/cygngtcp2-16.dll

(libngtcp2_crypto_gnutls8)
  /usr/bin/cygngtcp2_crypto_gnutls-8.dll

(libngtcp2_crypto_ossl0)
  /usr/bin/cygngtcp2_crypto_ossl-0.dll

(libngtcp2-devel)
  /usr/include/ngtcp2/ngtcp2.h
  /usr/include/ngtcp2/ngtcp2_crypto.h
  /usr/include/ngtcp2/version.h
  /usr/lib/libngtcp2.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libngtcp2.pc

(libngtcp2_crypto_gnutls-devel)
  /usr/include/ngtcp2/ngtcp2_crypto_gnutls.h
  /usr/lib/libngtcp2_crypto_gnutls.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libngtcp2_crypto_gnutls.pc

(libngtcp2_crypto_ossl-devel)
  /usr/include/ngtcp2/ngtcp2_crypto_ossl.h
  /usr/lib/libngtcp2_crypto_ossl.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libngtcp2_crypto_ossl.pc

